{"about_the_game":"<strong>The Aztecs</strong> - a Mesoamerican culture that flourished for three great centuries, dominating vast stretches of land in the area and creating a society unique in world history. A gifted and wise nation, rich in complex traditions and beliefs. <strong>Become an Aztec leader</strong> and do everything you can to make history remember your people.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/8ee440fd000dc47d2d3322b2d7eab16e.poster.avif?t=1752241950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/8ee440fd000dc47d2d3322b2d7eab16e.webm?t=1752241950\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Aztecs: The Last Sun</strong> is a city builder set between the 13th and 16th centuries CE. As your nation\u2019s great leader, you are responsible for building and bringing to splendor the magnificent <strong>city-state of Tenochtitlan</strong>. This amazing architectural wonder was historically located on an island in the middle of Lake Texcoco and therefore presents the technological and economic challenge of providing food for your people and maintain a permanent trade route with the outside world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/eff5e622b29d7a6cc271e4e9883ba4c5.poster.avif?t=1752241950\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/eff5e622b29d7a6cc271e4e9883ba4c5.webm?t=1752241950\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Aztecs: The Last Sun</strong> perfectly combines three different aspects of city management: Take care of <strong>economic</strong>, <strong>military </strong>and <strong>religious 